-limit","title":"Carney Deepens Europe Pivot","date":"2026-09-08","url":"https://zuhd.news/a/2026-09-08-carney-eu-pivot-north-south-infrastructure-limit"}]}},"mkt:asx":{"eventId":"mkt:asx:2026-09-11:-1","kind":"streak","changePct":-2.993041760534454,"newsHash":"0194507c172d0ba1","startDate":"2026-09-07","endDate":"2026-09-11","revision":1,"validated":null},"mkt:idx":{"eventId":"mkt:idx:2026-09-15:-1","kind":"streak","changePct":-3.369356488654651,"newsHash":"aa3ae5607daea1ee","startDate":"2026-09-08","endDate":"2026-09-15","revision":1,"validated":{"text":"Indonesian stocks had an unsettled week. The Jakarta market's benchmark fell 3.4% over five straight sessions to 15 September — a stretch in which Indonesia ousted its finance minister, Purbaya, and a Java Sea ferry sinking left scores missing. Whether traders were reacting to either is not established.","citations":[{"slug":"2026-09-15-the-reshuffle-reached-the-minister-who-ordered-it","title":"Indonesia Ousts Finance Minister","date":"2026-09-15","url":"https://zuhd.news/a/2026-09-15-the-reshuffle-reached-the-minister-who-ordered-it"},{"slug":"2026-09-14-more-than-120-unaccounted-for-after-ferry-sinks-in-indonesia","title":"Indonesia Ferry Leaves 129 Missing","date":"2026-09-14","url":"https://zuhd.news/a/2026-09-14-more-than-120-unaccounted-for-after-ferry-sinks-in-indonesia"}]}}}}